  "releaseNotes": "Version 2.30.42 - AM020 implicit nested conversion modelling\n\n            Changed:\n            - AM020 now uses Roslyn conversion classification after same-type, built-in, and collection ownership checks\n            - Compiler-known implicit nested object conversions are treated as safe\n            - Explicit-only nested conversions still report and require explicit mapping configuration\n\n            Validation:\n            - Full solution test suite passing on net10.0 (839 tests)\n            - Rule catalog and sample diagnostics snapshot checks passing\n            - PR #117 CI/package smoke checks passing\n            - git diff --check clean\n\n            Previous Release: v2.30.41 - AM021 implicit element conversion modelling",
